NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=
CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:3000

JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES=7d

# Used only by `npm run seed` to create the first admin account
ADMIN_NAME=
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

Now add these three lines to your real backend/.env with your own values (use a strong password, never reuse a real one):

ADMIN_NAME=Marketplace Admin
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=choose-a-strong-password-1